<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="om">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#EEF3F1">
<title>Adinan Dua App</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#EEF3F1;--card:#fff;--ink:#12302B;--mute:#5E7771;--acc:#0F6B5C;--gold:#B8892B;--line:#D3E0DB;--ok:#1E8E5A;--okt:#fff;--sh:0 2px 10px rgba(15,60,50,.08);--ar:1.6rem}
[data-eff="dark"]{--bg:#0C1A26;--card:#13293A;--ink:#E7EFF5;--mute:#98AFC0;--acc:#4FC3A8;--gold:#E3B95A;--line:#244157;--ok:#4FD08F;--okt:#06231a;--sh:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}
[data-size="s"]{--ar:1.3rem}[data-size="l"]{--ar:1.95rem}
*{box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
html,body{margin:0}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;transition:background .3s,color .3s}
main{max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 40px}
button{font:inherit;color:inherit}
.hdr{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 16px) 0 10px}
.ava{width:62px;height:62px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--gold);background:var(--card) center/cover no-repeat;color:var(--mute);font-size:.72rem;line-height:1.2;cursor:pointer;flex:none;padding:0}
.hello{flex:1;min-width:0}
.hello h1{font-size:1.15rem;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.hello p{margin:2px 0 0;color:var(--mute);font-size:.85rem}
.ib{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);font-size:1.15rem;cursor:pointer;flex:none}
.stk{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5;background:var(--bg);padding:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 6px) 0 10px}
.tabs{display:flex;gap:8px}
.tab{flex:1;padding:11px;border:2px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
.tab[aria-selected="true"]{border-color:var(--acc);background:var(--acc);color:#fff}
[data-eff="dark"] .tab[aria-selected="true"]{color:#06231a}
.prog{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:10px}
.pct{font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;min-width:66px;color:var(--acc)}
.bar{flex:1;height:10px;background:var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}
.bar i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--acc),var(--gold));border-radius:6px;transition:width .35s}
.cnt{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--mute);margin-top:4px;text-align:right}
.card{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:12px;box-shadow:var(--sh);cursor:pointer;transition:transform .12s,border-color .2s}
.card.pop{transform:scale(.985)}
.card.done{border-color:var(--ok)}
.ch{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--mute);font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600}
.cn{color:var(--gold)}
.ar{font-family:"Amiri","Traditional Arabic","Geeza Pro",serif;font-size:var(--ar);line-height:2.1;direction:rtl;text-align:right;margin:8px 0}
.cf{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.hint{color:var(--mute);font-size:.85rem}
.ring{position:relative;width:54px;height:54px}
.ring svg{width:54px;height:54px;transform:rotate(-90deg)}
.ring circle{fill:none;stroke-width:4}
.ring .bg{stroke:var(--line)}
.ring .fg{stroke:var(--gold);stroke-linecap:round;stroke-dasharray:119.4;stroke-dashoffset:119.4;transition:stroke-dashoffset .25s}
.done .ring .fg{stroke:var(--ok)}
.ring b{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1rem}
.done .ring b{color:var(--ok)}
.ov{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.55);display:none;align-items:flex-end;z-index:20}
.ov.on{display:flex}
.ov.c{align-items:center;padding:20px}
.panel{background:var(--bg);width:100%;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;max-height:90%;overflow:auto;border-radius:20px 20px 0 0;padding:18px 16px calc(24px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px))}
.c .panel{border-radius:22px;text-align:center;padding:28px 20px}
.panel h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:1.15rem}
.panel h3{margin:18px 0 4px;font-size:.8rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--mute)}
.row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.row input[type=text],.row input[type=time],.row select{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);color:var(--ink);max-width:55%}
.row input[type=checkbox]{width:24px;height:24px;accent-color:var(--acc)}
.btn{width:100%;padding:13px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--acc);color:#fff;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;margin-top:10px}
[data-eff="dark"] .btn{color:#06231a}
.btn.sec{background:var(--card);color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.note{color:var(--mute);font-size:.85rem;margin:8px 0 0}
.panel ol,.panel ul{padding-left:20px;margin:6px 0}
.panel li{margin-bottom:6px}
.ok{width:76px;height:76px;margin:0 auto 12px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ok);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.ok svg{width:42px;height:42px;stroke:var(--okt);stroke-width:5;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:60;stroke-dashoffset:60}
.on .ok svg{animation:dr .6s .15s forwards}
@keyframes dr{to{stroke-dashoffset:0}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important;animation:none!important}.on .ok svg{stroke-dashoffset:0}}
button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:2px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<div class="hdr">
  <button class="ava" id="ava" aria-label="Suura kaa’i">Suura<br>kaa’i</button>
  <div class="hello"><h1 id="hello"></h1><p id="sub"></p></div>
  <button class="ib" id="bhelp" aria-label="Qajeelfama">?</button>
  <button class="ib" id="bset" aria-label="Qindaa’ina">⚙</button>
</div>
<div class="stk">
  <div class="tabs" role="tablist">
    <button class="tab" role="tab" id="t-morning" data-s="morning">Ganama</button>
    <button class="tab" role="tab" id="t-evening" data-s="evening">Galgala</button>
  </div>
  <div class="prog"><div class="pct" id="pct">0%</div><div class="bar"><i id="fill"></i></div></div>
  <div class="cnt" id="cnt"></div>
</div>
<div id="list"></div>
<input type="file" id="pf" accept="image/*" hidden>
</main>

<div class="ov" id="set"><div class="panel" role="dialog" aria-label="Qindaa’ina">
  <h2>Qindaa’ina</h2>
  <h3>Ani</h3>
  <div class="row"><label for="nm">Maqaa</label><input type="text" id="nm" maxlength="20"></div>
  <div class="row"><span>Suura</span><span><button class="btn sec" id="chg" style="width:auto;margin:0;padding:8px 14px">Jijjiiri</button> <button class="btn sec" id="rm" style="width:auto;margin:0;padding:8px 14px">Haqi</button></span></div>
  <h3>Yaadachiisa</h3>
  <div class="row"><label for="nt">Notification</label><input type="checkbox" id="nt"></div>
  <div class="row"><label for="tm">Yeroo ganamaa</label><input type="time" id="tm"></div>
  <div class="row"><label for="te">Yeroo galgalaa</label><input type="time" id="te"></div>
  <button class="btn" id="sv">Yaadachiisa kaa’i</button>
  <p class="note" id="nmsg"></p>
  <h3>Bifa</h3>
  <div class="row"><label for="th">Halluu</label><select id="th"><option value="auto">Ofumaa</option><option value="light">Ifaa</option><option value="dark">Dukkana</option></select></div>
  <div class="row"><label for="sz">Guddina Arabiffaa</label><select id="sz"><option value="s">Xiqqaa</option><option value="m">Giddu galeessa</option><option value="l">Guddaa</option></select></div>
  <div class="row"><label for="vb">Raafamuu (vibration)</label><input type="checkbox" id="vb"></div>
  <h3>Odeeffannoo</h3>
  <button class="btn sec" id="rs">Galmee har’aa haaromsi</button>
  <button class="btn" id="cl">Cufi</button>
</div></div>

<div class="ov" id="help"><div class="panel" role="dialog" aria-label="Qajeelfama">
  <h2>Akkaataa itti fayyadamuu</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Gubbaa irratti <b>Ganama</b> ykn <b>Galgala</b> filadhaa. App yeroo irratti hundaa’uun ofumaa filata.</li>
    <li>Duaa’ii kaardii tokko tokko irratti dubbisaa; yeroo tokko dubbistan kaardii <b>tuqaa</b>. Lakkoofsi sun gadi bu’a.</li>
    <li>Lakkoofsi 0 yeroo ga’u kaardiin magariifa ta’a (✓).</li>
    <li>Gubbaa irratti <b>%</b> duaa’ii hunda walitti qabee agarsiisa.</li>
    <li>Hunda yeroo xumurtan ergaa galateefi agarsiisa.</li>
    <li><b>⚙ Qindaa’ina</b> keessatti maqaa, suura, yeroo yaadachiisaa, bifa fi guddina barreeffamaa jijjiiruu dandeessu.</li>
  </ol>
  <h3>Akkaataa dubbisuu</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Ikhlaasaan (Allaah qofaaf) dubbisaa, garaa keessanis dubbisaa wajjin haa jiraatu.</li>
    <li>Yoo danda’ame wudhuu godhaa, kallattii bakka qulqulluu taa’aa.</li>
    <li>Jechoota sirriitti, suuta jedhaa, hiikaa isaanii hubachuuf yaalaa.</li>
    <li>Lakkoofsi kaardii irratti barreeffame (3, 7, 10, 100) akka jirutti irra deebi’aa.</li>
    <li>Yeroon ganamaa Fajrii booda eegala, kan galgalaa Asrii booda eegala. Yoo dagatan, yeroo yaadattan dubbisaa.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="note">Barreeffama Arabiffaa kitaaba amanamaa waliin yeroo yeroon sakatta’aa.</p>
  <button class="btn" id="hc">Hubadheera</button>
</div></div>

<div class="ov c" id="done"><div class="panel" role="dialog" aria-label="Baga gammaddan">
  <div class="ok"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><path d="M10 25l9 9 19-20"/></svg></div>
  <h2 id="dt"></h2>
  <p id="dm"></p>
  <p class="note">Allaah hojii keessan haa fudhatu, ajara guddaas isiniif haa kennu. Aamiin.</p>
  <button class="btn" id="dc">Aamiin</button>
</div></div>

